          <p>Kigali, Rwanda – 2 Werurwe 2026 — Amatora y’inzego z’Urugaga rw’Abikorera (PSF) azatangira Kuva tariki 9-16 Werurwe 2026. Iki gikorwa (cy’amatora) kizakorwa ku nzego zose za PSF, Uhereye ku rwego rw’Akarere, Intara n’Umujyi wa Kigali, Amahuriro (Chambers) no kurwego rw’Igihugu. Umuyobozi Mukuru wa PSF, Bwana Stephen Ruzibiza, yagize ati; “Turashimira byimazeyo abayobozi basoje manda zabo ku ruhare rukomeye bagize mu guteza imbere PSF n’ubukungu bw’Igihugu mu rirusange. Mu gihe twitegura aya matora, turabizi ko atari ugusimburana mu buyobozi gusa; ni no kongera gushinga imizi n’indangagaciro z’Urugaga mu kwagura iterambere ry’ubukungu muri rusange. Ayamatora nikimwe mu mahirwe yo kwihitiramo abayobozi bazatugeza kwiterambere rirambye.”</p>
